            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Multī lībertīnī in urbe tabernās habent. Many freedmen keep shops in the city."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. Lībertīnus names a freed slave's rank in society, lībertus his tie to his former master."
